  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 82444,
  "published": "2026-09-09T08:22:44.24Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.5.0: the send audit gains a first-class Category (event-type) column on FirebaseNotificationDispatches, populated from the message data key (FirebaseStoreOptions.CategoryDataKey, default \"category\") and filterable via NotificationDispatchQuery.Category, so admin history can be filtered by event type without parsing JSON. Adds a column + index: generate one store migration after upgrading. Non-breaking. 3.4.0: complete send auditing across all audiences (Users, Broadcast, Tokens, Topic, Condition) into FirebaseNotificationDispatches. 3.3.0: data/options types unsealed for inheritance.",
